Use Kodi's CA bundle for FFmpeg's initial and nested TLS connections.

The console has no GnuTLS system trust store. HTTPS fails with "Peer
certificate failed verification" even though Kodi's curl trusts the same
server. Inject Kodi's translated CA bundle and require TLS verification on
each format I/O open: HLS does not copy these options to segment requests.
Delegate to FFmpeg's original callback to preserve its protocol restrictions,
interrupt handling and native URL contexts used for HTTP connection reuse.

Upstream: PS5-only; this patch series is not applied on other platforms.

--- a/src/stream/FFmpegStream.h
